WEBVTT

00:00:00.211 --> 00:00:02.456
How to sell <b>by the kilo</b>

00:00:02.507 --> 00:00:08.138
When you tap a product sold by kilo, the weight entry opens

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.592
With a scale connected, the weight comes in on its own

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:18.474
Without a scale, type it: 3, 5, 0 is <b>350 grams</b>

00:00:18.597 --> 00:00:23.032
MiCaja works out the price and adds it to the cart
